      "type": "watering",
      "description": "Water deeply two or three times a week, more in heat; keep it even to avoid blossom-end rot and split fruit. Water the soil, not the leaves."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "sunlight",
      "description": "Six to eight hours of full sun. Less sun means fewer, later fruit."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "pruning",
      "description": "Pinch out suckers on indeterminate types and tie to a stake or cage as it grows. Pick fruit when fully coloured and slightly soft."
